`;var nH=`/* 2.8 (\u04124.1, \u04126.1): ready questions in the empty chat, and the follow-up questions under the latest answer. Full-width
   rows that read as questions (start-aligned, wrapping), not chips; the consent's text under them while it isn't given. */
